OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDespite
OL,6,Ftemperatures recovering slightly, it
OL,7,Fwill be another cold, dry night for
OL,8,FEngland and Wales with frost
OL,9,Fdeveloping inland. Bands of rain over
OL,10,Fcentral Scotland and Northern Ireland
OL,11,Fwhere it will be chilly and damp but
OL,12,Fnot frosty.
OL,13,
OL,14,CSunday:FFor Wales and southern
OL,15,FEngland, passing showers, possibly
OL,16,Fthundery in the southwest. Persistent
OL,17,Frain at times for southern Scotland
OL,18,Fand northern England. Brighter and
OL,19,Fshowery in the north and west.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
